     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>On Windows 8.1 64 bit, ggvis does not seem to draw input_slider in the right location. Did anyone else experience this problem?</div><div><br></div><div>For instance, if I run the code from one of the vignettes, </div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>mtcars </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">wt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mpg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    layer_smooths</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">span </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input_slider</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    layer_points</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input_slider</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div>the plot looks like this. As you can see the input sliders are squeezed and located on the left hand side of the plot. It looks the same even if I display the plot in Chrome as well.<br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-xUb3uGPJlZ0/VSGoPDgxoJI/AAAAAAAABCA/oyAjFa4ViJ8/s1600/slider_problem.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-xUb3uGPJlZ0/VSGoPDgxoJI/AAAAAAAABCA/oyAjFa4ViJ8/s1600/slider_problem.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484750464000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3HR2DUEIWjpTsLVjXCEWDB\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-xUb3uGPJlZ0/VSGoPDgxoJI/AAAAAAAABCA/oyAjFa4ViJ8/s320/slider_problem.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"247\"></a></p><div><br></div><div>This is a problem unique to windows 8.1 because the same code puts input_sliders below the plot correctly in Ubuntu 14.04.2 64 bit (in virtualbox) . Is there anything I should do to make this work on Windows 8.1? Rstudio version is 0.98.1103 and the session information is as follows. </div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sessionInfo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>R version </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2015</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">03</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">09</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Platform</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x86_64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mingw32</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x64 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Running</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> under</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Windows</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x64 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">build </span><span style=\"color:#066\">9200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>locale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> LC_COLLATE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#606\">English_United</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">States</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1252</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  LC_CTYPE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span